IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `cards-domain`
IMPORT `earn-kernel`

§ `Fixtures -- the purchases, cardholders and months the issuer modules' assertions are built from`

-- ===========================================================================
-- TEST SCAFFOLDING ONLY. Nothing here states a rate, a cap or an exclusion.
-- L4 has no record-update operator, so a purchase that differs from the base
-- in one field is built by a setter that rebuilds the other fifteen from the
-- base. `the purchase p coded as code`, `flagged as` and `through` are in
-- earn-kernel.l4.
--
-- THE BASE PURCHASE is S$100 charged on 5 October 2026 and posted on 7
-- October 2026 at an unnamed merchant in Singapore, coded 5812, paid with the
-- physical card tapped on a reader, the merchant flagging card-present. It is
-- an ordinary retail purchase that no list in any held document names.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `The base purchase`

`the base purchase` MEANS
    Purchase WITH
        `amount in SGD`        IS 100
        `date charged`         IS Date 5 10 2026
        `date posted`          IS Date 7 10 2026
        `posting status`       IS `Posted to the account`
        `charge kind`          IS `Retail purchase`
        currency               IS `Singapore dollars`
        gateway                IS `A gateway in Singapore`
        `store location`       IS `A store in Singapore`
        presentation           IS `Physical card tapped on a reader`
        `merchant indicator`   IS `Flags card-present`
        merchant               IS `Another merchant`
        outlet                 IS `An ordinary outlet`
        item                   IS `An ordinary item`
        mcc                    IS JUST 5812
        descriptor             IS `Another description`
        `later reversed`       IS FALSE


§§ `Setters`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase, amount IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A Purchase
`purchase for` p amount MEANS
    Purchase WITH
        `amount in SGD`        IS amount
        `date charged`         IS p's `date charged`
        `date posted`          IS p's `date posted`
        `posting status`       IS p's `posting status`
        `charge kind`          IS p's `charge kind`
        currency               IS p's currency
        gateway                IS p's gateway
        `store location`       IS p's `store location`
        presentation           IS p's presentation
        `merchant indicator`   IS p's `merchant indicator`
        merchant               IS p's merchant
        outlet                 IS p's outlet
        item                   IS p's item
        mcc                    IS p's mcc
        descriptor             IS p's descriptor
        `later reversed`       IS p's `later reversed`

GIVEN p IS A Purchase, day IS A DATE
GIVETH A Purchase
`purchase charged on` p day MEANS
    Purchase WITH
        `amount in SGD`        IS p's `amount in SGD`
        `date charged`         IS day
        `date posted`          IS p's `date posted`
        `posting status`       IS p's `posting status`
        `charge kind`          IS p's `charge kind`
        currency               IS p's currency
        gateway                IS p's gateway
        `store location`       IS p's `store location`
        presentation           IS p's presentation
        `merchant indicator`   IS p's `merchant indicator`
        merchant               IS p's merchant
        outlet                 IS p's outlet
        item                   IS p's item
        mcc                    IS p's mcc
        descriptor             IS p's descriptor
        `later reversed`       IS p's `later reversed`

